[{"title":"霜迟乐","author":"方登峄","text":"七月不落霜，卜魁城边糜子黄。\n八月霜不落，千夫下田总欢乐。\n官田刈谷载满车，官兵急公先完租。\n毳帐牛车十日路，驱向城中易茶布。\n和茶煮谷布裁衣，卒岁不忧寒与饥。\n人人尽乐霜迟好，荞麦沙田收更早。\n但愿年年不出兵，官兵皆作农夫老。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28378,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七兄以诗慰病和答","author":"方登峄","text":"形骸百炼后，心事五更中。\n苦海终无岸，愁城岂易攻。\n道危迷老马，边远失归鸿。\n谁谓青天阔，浮云亦碍空。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28379,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪事","author":"方登峄","text":"争看金甲健儿装，玉辇云移下凤皇。\n都尉鱼丽开细柳，将军猿臂射长杨。\n蟊孤露冷摇秋月，韎韐风高带晓霜。\n大阅至尊非好武，良弓不为太平藏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28380,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与毛会侯","author":"方登峄","text":"耆英洛社旧登坛，四十归来早罢官。\n赴召有谁谗贾谊，输租今已累儿宽。\n休嫌华发功名薄，毕竟青山岁月难。\n诗酒柴桑堪闭户，文章千古不凋残。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28381,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"河堤曲二首 其一","author":"蒋楛","text":"走河堤，风凄凄，黄云黯黯落日低。\n沙边丛树半枯死，荒村无人鸦乱啼。\n走河堤，风凄凄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28382,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"河堤曲二首 其二","author":"蒋楛","text":"走河曲，风簌簌，填柴作岸芦作屋。\n西风一夜钜野流，鱼头赤子千家哭。\n走河曲，风簌簌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28383,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠方望子入黄山修炼","author":"濮淙","text":"诗成当代说方干，何事辞家久不还。\n梦里汤泉非故国，眼前云海是名山。\n花深古灶凭烧药，月冷啼猿为守关。\n只是白头慈母在，不教容易别人间。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28384,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日游白茅寺次少陵韵","author":"王戬","text":"天空灵籁发，入耳心逾静。\n何许微风过，月林摇客影。\n人生五浊世，为欢苦不永。\n争如羝触藩，有如瓶堕井。\n及兹清夜游，无辞烛共秉。\n佛香一院深，僧梵四山迥。\n身尚依迦叶，足真践箕颍。\n禅灯照宵梦，妄念未能屏。\n金篦开倦眼，慧目陟东岭。\n他时礼白云，应上最高顶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28385,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读放翁集","author":"王戬","text":"南流四杰俱惊才，醉心尤在渭南伯。\n江翻海立富篇章，跃马弯弓老梁益。\n一寸丹心常炯然，归来垂钓镜湖边。\n却怜老死空家祭，不见王师北定年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28386,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"姑苏杨柳枝词二首 其一","author":"顾希哲","text":"行春桥下午风和，画舫楼船次第过。\n一面青山三面水，不知何处柳阴多？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28387,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"姑苏杨柳枝词二首 其二","author":"顾希哲","text":"越国佳人旧有名，吴中娇舞不胜情。\n柳腰合是芳魂化，长向胥台一路生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28388,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己巳六月拜别家慈之楚","author":"许润","text":"荒鸡断续天将曙，游子辞亲寸心悸。\n霜鬓携灯立槛前，频语加餐暗垂涕。\n舟子招招促行李，残书数卷裹破被。\n解维咫尺是天涯，回首空闾人独倚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28389,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闽溪舟行即事","author":"许润","text":"天设南闽多险阻，古今劳役几时休？\n下滩疑泛银河水，上濑如牵陆地舟。\n响应风湍歌欸乃，身藏云木叫?辀。\n笔床茶灶延缘好，准拟浮生托白鸥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28390,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"戊子春自岭南奉老母挈家旋闽","author":"许润","text":"行囊带得岭头春，荔浦珠江过眼频。\n半世总为天外客，一家今是故乡人。\n回看东粤名山远，好补《南陔》乐事真。\n莫问田庐在何处，洛阳季子本清贫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28391,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟泊剑津怀亡友刘复庵","author":"许润","text":"分手齐安隔数春，何缘龙剑合延津。\n可堪风雨孤舟夜，白发盈头哭故人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28392,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"武昌","author":"毛世楷","text":"百战江山一水萍，武昌宫阙旧亭亭。\n枝梧蜀汉争持角，控制东南欲建瓴。\n未定中原安枕席，底思建业厌鱼鲭。\n只今铁锁销沉后，浪打寒潮入穴青。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28393,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日感怀","author":"毛世楷","text":"秋夜焚香醮玉真，秋河靥靥动星辰。\n人间何处投金濑，天上徒闻析木津。\n同学少年悲杜甫，美人迟暮感灵均。\n青天碧海吾无悔，且泛南溪采白蘋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28394,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"汉阳旅中送蔡子汇征游湘潭","author":"杨横","text":"相送斜阳外，相逢更几时？\n共来荆楚地，还赋别离诗。\n祖席杯堪把，河桥柳挂丝。\n洞庭他夜月，千里系遐思。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28395,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闰六月初七夜月","author":"杨横","text":"南讹莫认火西流，顾兔高悬略似钩。\n四日魄生方入夜，七回弦上未成秋。\n先期乞巧穿针线，后月舒光照女牛。\n半露姮娥能却暑，广寒深处玉为楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28396,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"荒亭","author":"沈畯","text":"荒亭古墓南，远见车尘灭。\n墓前双石人，送尽人离别。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28397,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九日","author":"沈畯","text":"有酒赏重阳，无烦白衣至。\n恐惊邻舍翁，谓是催租吏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28398,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山海关","author":"吴启元","text":"地临辽蓟中分界，天限华夷第一关。\n直绕长城东到海，凌空高障北依山。\n当年士马何曾战，此日梯航尚未闲。\n闻道乘槎通绝域，可能身入斗牛间？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28399,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"广宁望医巫闾山雪吊汉管处士","author":"吴启元","text":"巫闾山上雪漫漫，何处峰头著幼安。\n木榻跪穿心久定，黄金锄去眼谁看？\n沧江水涸蛟龙徙，大漠风高鸑鷟寒。\n我亦子陵台畔客，绿蓑青笠一渔竿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28400,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画","author":"沈钟彦","text":"春林如画罨朝曦，燕立秾阴湿不飞。\n柳外有楼帘半卷，掠花双剪莫忘归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28401,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"罂粟花","author":"沈钟彦","text":"炊烟时或断贫家，晓起俄看五色霞。\n任尔侏儒夸独饱，篱头已放火囊花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28402,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金钱花","author":"沈钟彦","text":"邓氏铜山虚设想，沈郎榆荚许为邻。\n清宵风露频频掷，似向空庭卜远人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28403,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"钱塘怀古","author":"沈绍姬","text":"城上黄云锁戍楼，城头古木叫钩辀。\n地从江底分吴越，天向栏前挂女牛。\n尚有荒祠题伍员，曾无杯酒祀钱镠。\n可怜人事今萧索，花草依然发故丘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28404,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄怀查伊璜先辈","author":"沈绍姬","text":"亭亭绝巘结萧斋，高峙龙门百尺阶。\n苏晋堂前宜绣佛，马融帐后有金钗。\n凄凉歌板怜君僻，磊落文章与世乖。\n爱我巴歌长击节，汝南月旦愧《齐谐》。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28405,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杜鹃","author":"沈绍姬","text":"年年啼遍欲残春，午夜枝头血满唇。\n不尽羁魂悲蜀道，何来处士感天津。\n声中似怨无家别，地下应怜再拜人。\n纵使欲归归便得，故宫何处更容身？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28406,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄家人","author":"沈绍姬","text":"归来偕隐计犹虚，垂老他乡叹索居。\n别久乍疑前劫事，路歧才得去年书。\n梦如柳絮飞无定，愁似芭蕉卷未舒。\n记得小园亲手植，一栏红药近何如？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28407,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"司马懿故居","author":"沈绍姬","text":"王业偏安蜀道难，奸雄宁独数曹瞒。\n中原回首移神鼎，竖子成名建禅坛。\n城上风幡新塔宇，墓中巾帼旧衣冠。\n掀髯西指蚕丛路，丞相祠堂尚锦官。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28408,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题前监军闻启详传后","author":"沈绍姬","text":"嚼齿穿龈死不辞，千秋名教得操持。\n门生谁续《招魂》赋，狱吏亲闻绝命诗。\n总为人门留正气，不求马革裹全尸。\n盛朝若举褒忠典，应敕盱江好建祠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28409,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"淮阴侯","author":"沈绍姬","text":"鼎足才堪角两雄，当年应悔灭重瞳。\n分羹父子恩犹薄，推食君臣谊岂终。\n独有千金酬漂母，曾无一语感滕公。\n名成自古身当退，没齿休论战伐功。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28410,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题韩蕲王湖上策蹇图","author":"沈绍姬","text":"南渡何人主庙谟，清凉居士老西湖。\n两朝和议分棋墅，百战雄心付酒垆。\n策蹇山前逢故吏，参禅花底坐浮屠。\n只今犹恨丹青手，不画麒麟阁上图。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28411,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蛟","author":"沈绍姬","text":"斗室何来豹脚蚁，殷如雷鼓聚如云。\n无多一点英雄血，闲到衰年忍付君！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28412,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏古二首 其一","author":"沈绍姬","text":"脱颖人成公子名，不然碌碌竟何称。\n夷门虚己真知己，莫绣平原绣信陵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28413,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏古二首 其二","author":"沈绍姬","text":"为报韩仇奋一椎，副车虽误亦雄哉！\n淮阴也是韩王后，何用当时蹑足来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28414,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"进峡","author":"张衍懿","text":"峡自夷陵束，江从白帝悬。\n两崖如剑立，百丈入云牵。\n石出疑无路，云开别有天。\n往来频陟险，千里正茫然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28415,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"瞿唐峡","author":"张衍懿","text":"历数西南险，瞿唐自古闻。\n水从天上落，路向石中分。\n如马惊秋涨，哀猿叫夕曛。\n乘流千里疾，回首万重云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28416,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过马伏波墓","author":"张衍懿","text":"漆水东流绕墓田，伏波埋土几千年？\n西风但见吹残鬣，南海犹闻畏跕鸢。\n岂有明珠来戚里，空留铜柱在炎天。\n功成未得云台画，回首荒原一惘然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28417,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"度梅岭","author":"张衍懿","text":"拔起危峰万仞雄，势临百粤控南中。\n人从丹壁千盘上，路入青天一箭通。\n古碣尚留唐相迹，荒祠谁祀越王功。\n只今四海梯航日，早见征车度晓风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28418,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"大侄书金陵回即走西安怅然念之","author":"孙中岳","text":"才解征鞍又远行，相看意气转纵横。\n故宫荒草埋金狄，客路秋风动石鲸。\n词笔已从梁苑秃，诗情又向灞桥生。\n陇头流水声幽咽，似我频年送别情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28419,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟泊武林城外因忆新安会稽之胜赋呈确庵夫子志别","author":"王誉昌","text":"四月河桥绿酎浓，篷窗歌咏自从容。\n人间草木馀春梦，劫后湖山又晚钟。\n学溯考亭开雾障，书探禹穴破云封。\n重期此后追随处，知在烟萝第几峰？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28420,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过东郊故园追和家大人韵","author":"王誉昌","text":"昔年亭馆筑城闉，此日重游自怆神。\n十亩仅传三世业，一身已作两朝人。\n门前碧草埋荒径，楼上青山认旧邻。\n记得趋庭分彩笔，也教题咏药栏春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28421,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鹦鹉词","author":"王誉昌","text":"翻为多情损性灵，断魂还认陇山青。\n何因得证摩尼塔，一卷笼中《般若经》。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28422,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日送张梅庄之维扬二首 其一","author":"谢志发","text":"春郊烟景浓于酒，万缕千丝堤畔柳。\n当杯惜别暂流连，长条能绾离情否？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28423,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日送张梅庄之维扬二首 其二","author":"谢志发","text":"挂帆暮霭指维扬，渡口分飞各一方。\n一苇不从张仲去，思随飞絮绕雷塘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28424,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过褚渔黄山居","author":"谢志发","text":"数峰深曲径，返朴遂栖迟。\n虚室云为牖，成邻鹤在枝。\n漱甘临涧石，遁迹称茅茨。\n客至青精饭，长镵共采芝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28425,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过旧送别处","author":"谢志发","text":"忆昔亭前柳，分携曾系船。\n至今攀折处，犹是锁愁烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28426,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"绣谷堂中牡丹今岁惟开一枝杨子鹤马扶羲徐采若暨目存上人各为作图王石谷补一石余为题句","author":"姜实节","text":"四人分写一花枝，写出传看朵朵奇。\n恰似《兰亭》摹拓本，浅深肥瘦各相宜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28427,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"白头公鸟","author":"姜实节","text":"霜鬓逢春可自由，老人端的为多愁。\n不知小鸟缘何事，也向花前白了头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28428,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雕","author":"姜实节","text":"天山白草路横分，日暮悲笳不忍闻。\n想得玉关方转战，皂雕风起欲盘云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28429,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题簪花图","author":"姜实节","text":"六年前见倾城色，犹是云英未嫁身。\n今日相逢重问姓，座中愁杀白头人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28430,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"古诗 其一","author":"吴祖修","text":"兀坐一室中，澄观若止水。\n群动既已息，万籁不到耳。\n方寸涵灵台，光明畴与比。\n此中无将迎，安用起磈礌。\n蒙庄旷达人，亦未解斯旨。\n如何逃虚空，跫然足音喜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28431,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"古诗 其二","author":"吴祖修","text":"少陵薄文章，谓非道所尊。\n不读破万卷，何由闻斯论。\n经史足驱使，今古堪胚浑。\n寂若万象灭，灿若众星繁。\n根柢有至理，刊落皆陈言。\n以此为诗史，孰能穷其源。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28432,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"侍家君渡江时有风涛之恐","author":"吴祖修","text":"日斜问渡汉阳门，双桨中流浪欲翻。\n人世那能容李白，风波何必系章惇。\n惊心频洒途穷泪，剪纸难招定后魂。\n还是故乡风景好，鲈鱼莼菜足江村。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28433,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书牧斋诗后","author":"吴祖修","text":"红豆山庄拂岫青，客来犹见子云亭。\n当年党论推尊宿，近日骚坛尚典型。\n不死似将成汉史，孤生忍独守《玄经》。\n延登旧恨君休诧，目断台阶两两星。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28434,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书梅村诗后","author":"吴祖修","text":"梦回龙尾醒犹残，重入春明兴转阑。\n宣去可能如老铁，放归未便戴黄冠。\n悲歌自觉高官误，读史应知名士难。\n今日九泉逢故友，西台涕泪几时干？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28435,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读司马相如传","author":"吴祖修","text":"绮靡文传是《子虚》，曲终雅奏竟何如？\n后人嗤点《凌云赋》，曾读当时《谏猎书》。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28436,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读王褒传","author":"吴祖修","text":"金马祠神事已遥，子渊才擅汉宣朝。\n非无《圣主贤臣颂》，只教宫人记《洞箫》。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28437,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄示赵书年陈起雷","author":"吴祖修","text":"千里歌骊竟不闻，尚思尊酒数论文。\n过门不入能无憾，未敢人前薄待君。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28438,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂诗","author":"陈炳","text":"斧柯不到处，恶木易成林。\n君子抱渴疾，偶然息其阴。\n端人贵洁己，宁使霜露侵。\n事往悔何及，喟焉伤我心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28439,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"汉上","author":"陈炳","text":"楚国江山古，维舟望渺然。\n山盘青入蜀，江合白吞天。\n樊口上寒月，汉阳生暝烟。\n欲寻抱瓮者，小别夕阳边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28440,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寻马山人不遇","author":"陈炳","text":"一壑冷云白，山家何处寻？\n忽逢采樵者，遥指梅花林。\n曲径吠寒犬，短篱鸣野禽。\n柴门闭幽寂，独立听泉音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28441,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病中杂诗 其一","author":"文掞","text":"十日发不梳，五日面不靧。\n久病卧荒村，秋深积阴晦。\n体弱殊畏冷，破衲已可爱。\n晚晴秋更佳，山色遥如黛。\n我当拭几尘，推窗坐相对。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28442,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病中杂诗 其二","author":"文掞","text":"吾爱陆渭南，一生常善病。\n谓非酒色来，虽病元气正。\n双眼涩如棘，支颐犹高咏。\n省事兼寡言，能使心无竞。\n病亦不迎医，书卷养性命。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28443,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏史 其一","author":"李必恒","text":"方朔仕汉廷，事道非玩世。\n时时一讽谏，彼自敬其事。\n叩头诛董偃，凛凛直臣义。\n岂得以诙谐，目之曰游戏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28444,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏史 其二","author":"李必恒","text":"文成甫伏诛，五利夏亲属。\n爵禄尚可捐，何至弃骨肉。\n天子而神仙，人苦不知足。\n汲黯言诚戆，陛下内多欲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":28445,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]